prompts.keyword_expansion:
I am searching Facebook for groups on this topic: {topic}.
What counts: {topic_description}

List 25 short Facebook group search terms (2-4 words each) that would surface relevant UK groups. Cover different angles: campaigning, wildlife, litter picking, sustainability, local action groups, etc. Output one term per line, no numbering, no commentary.

prompts.stage1_filter:
You are assessing whether a Facebook group belongs to this topic: {topic}.
What counts: {topic_description}
The Facebook group name is: '{group_name}'. {about_context}Answer 'Yes' if the group clearly fits the topic, 'No' if it obviously does not (wrong subject, outside the UK, buying/selling, spam). When in doubt prefer 'Unsure' - these results are reviewed later. Only answer with the single word: 'Yes', 'Unsure', or 'No'.

prompts.stage2_with_posts:
You are making a final decision on whether a Facebook group belongs to this topic: {topic}.
What counts: {topic_description}
The Facebook group name is: '{group_name}'. {about_context}A sample of its recent posts:
{posts}

Answer 'Yes' if the posts show it is genuinely a UK group on this topic, otherwise 'No'. Only answer with the single word: 'Yes', 'Unsure', or 'No'.
